<h2 data-start=3D"73" data-end=3D"94" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"76" =
data-end=3D"92">Introduction</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"95" data-end=3D"436" class=3D"">Un r=C3=A9seau est un ense=
mble d=E2=80=99ordinateurs et d=E2=80=99=C3=A9quipements connect=C3=A9s ent=
re eux pour =C3=A9changer des informations. Il joue un r=C3=B4le fondamenta=
l dans notre monde moderne, permettant la communication, le partage de ress=
ources et l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 Internet. Ce tutoriel vous guidera de mani=C3=
=A8re progressive, du concept de base aux notions avanc=C3=A9es des r=C3=A9=
seaux.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"438" data-end=3D"441" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"443" data-end=3D"504" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"44=
5" data-end=3D"504">Chapitre 1 : Introduction aux R=C3=A9seaux (Niveau D=C3=
=A9butant)</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"506" data-end=3D"554" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"50=
9" data-end=3D"552">1.1 D=C3=A9finition d=E2=80=99un r=C3=A9seau informatiq=
ue</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"555" data-end=3D"780" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=3D"=
558" data-end=3D"581">r=C3=A9seau informatique</strong> est un ensemble de =
dispositifs (ordinateurs, serveurs, routeurs, etc.) interconnect=C3=A9s afi=
n de communiquer et partager des ressources, comme des fichiers, des applic=
ations, ou une connexion Internet.</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"782" data-end=3D"824" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"78=
5" data-end=3D"822">1.2 Pourquoi utiliser un r=C3=A9seau ?</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"825" data-end=3D"861" class=3D"">Un r=C3=A9seau informatiq=
ue permet de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"1170">
<li data-start=3D"862" data-end=3D"936" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"864" data-end=3D"936" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"864=
" data-end=3D"891">Partager des ressources</strong> : imprimantes, fichiers=
, bases de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"1020" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"939" data-end=3D"1020" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"93=
9" data-end=3D"969">Faciliter la communication</strong> : e-mails, messager=
ie instantan=C3=A9e, appels vid=C3=A9o.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1021" data-end=3D"1085" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1023" data-end=3D"1085" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
023" data-end=3D"1049">Am=C3=A9liorer l=E2=80=99efficacit=C3=A9</strong> : =
acc=C3=A8s aux donn=C3=A9es centralis=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1086" data-end=3D"1170" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1088" data-end=3D"1170" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
088" data-end=3D"1109">R=C3=A9duire les co=C3=BBts</strong> : mutualisation=
 des ressources mat=C3=A9rielles et logicielles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start=3D"1172" data-end=3D"1215" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
1175" data-end=3D"1213">1.3 Types de r=C3=A9seaux informatiques</strong></h=
2>
<p data-start=3D"1216" data-end=3D"1312" class=3D"">Les r=C3=A9seaux se cla=
ssent en plusieurs cat=C3=A9gories en fonction de leur taille et de leur po=
rt=C3=A9e :</p>
<div class=3D"overflow-x-auto contain-inline-size"><table data-start=3D"131=
4" data-end=3D"1906" node=3D"[object Object]"><thead data-start=3D"1314" da=
