s, t=C3=A9l=C3=A9phones, serveurs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2078" data-end=3D"2136" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2080" data-end=3D"2136" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
080" data-end=3D"2102">=C3=89quipements r=C3=A9seau</strong> : routeurs, co=
mmutateurs, modems.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2137" data-end=3D"2214" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2139" data-end=3D"2214" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
139" data-end=3D"2167">Supports de transmission</strong> : c=C3=A2bles Ethe=
rnet, fibre optique, ondes radio.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2215" data-end=3D"2252" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2217" data-end=3D"2252" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
217" data-end=3D"2231">Protocoles</strong> : TCP/IP, HTTP, DNS.</p>
</li>
</ul>
