ata-start=3D"2456" data-end=3D"2467">Wi-Fi 6</strong> (802.11ax) sont les d=
erni=C3=A8res normes utilis=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2517" data-end=3D"2555" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2521" data-end=3D"2555">2.1.1 Composants cl=C3=A9s du Wi-Fi</strong></h3>
