831" data-end=3D"3843">Radio FM</strong> : Tr=C3=A8s populaire dans les tra=
nsmissions radio de haute qualit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3908" data-end=3D"4008" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3910" data-end=3D"4008" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
910" data-end=3D"3935">T=C3=A9l=C3=A9vision analogique</strong> : Utilis=C3=
=A9e pour la transmission du son dans les =C3=A9missions de t=C3=A9l=C3=A9v=
ision.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4010" data-end=3D"4050" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4014" data-end=3D"4050">2.2.3 Avantages et Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong></h3>
