<h2 data-start=3D"4279" data-end=3D"4314" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4282" data-end=3D"4314">2.3 Modulation de Phase (PM)</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4316" data-end=3D"4364" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4320" data-end=3D"4364">2.3.1 Principe de la Modulation de Phase</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"4365" data-end=3D"4571" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"4368" data-end=3D"4396">modulation de phase (PM)</strong> consiste =C3=
=A0 modifier la phase de la porteuse en fonction de l'information. La phase=
 du signal porteuse change de mani=C3=A8re proportionnelle =C3=A0 l'amplitu=
de du signal d'information.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4573" data-end=3D"4608" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4577" data-end=3D"4608">2.3.2 Applications de la PM</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4609" data-end=3D"4790">
<li data-start=3D"4609" data-end=3D"4790" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4611" data-end=3D"4790" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
611" data-end=3D"4650">Syst=C3=A8mes de communication num=C3=A9rique</stron=
g> : La modulation de phase est utilis=C3=A9e dans des syst=C3=A8mes comme =
le <strong data-start=3D"4716" data-end=3D"4756">QPSK (Quadrature Phase Shi=
ft Keying)</strong> dans les communications sans fil.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4792" data-end=3D"4832" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4796" data-end=3D"4832">2.3.3 Avantages et Inconv=C3=A9nients</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"5062">
<li data-start=3D"4833" data-end=3D"4944" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4835" data-end=3D"4850" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
835" data-end=3D"4848">Avantages</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4853" data-end=3D"4944">
<li data-start=3D"4853" data-end=3D"4897" class=3D"">
