<hr data-start=3D"5064" data-end=3D"5067" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"5069" data-end=3D"5140" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5071" data-end=3D"5140">Chapitre 3 : Modulation Num=C3=A9rique (Niveau Inte=
rm=C3=A9diaire =C3=A0 Avanc=C3=A9)</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"5142" data-end=3D"5443" class=3D"">La modulation num=C3=A9=
rique est utilis=C3=A9e pour transmettre des donn=C3=A9es sous forme binair=
e (0 et 1). Les techniques num=C3=A9riques sont particuli=C3=A8rement adapt=
=C3=A9es aux syst=C3=A8mes modernes de communication, car elles permettent =
de traiter plus efficacement les signaux tout en minimisant les erreurs de =
transmission.</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"5445" data-end=3D"5485" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5448" data-end=3D"5485">3.1 Types de Modulation Num=C3=A9rique</strong></h2=
>
<p data-start=3D"5487" data-end=3D"5545" class=3D"">Les deux techniques de =
base de modulation num=C3=A9rique sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5547" data-end=3D"5645">
<li data-start=3D"5547" data-end=3D"5594" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5549" data-end=3D"5594" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
549" data-end=3D"5594">Modulation par D=C3=A9placement de Phase (PSK)</stro=
ng></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5595" data-end=3D"5645" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5597" data-end=3D"5645" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
597" data-end=3D"5645">Modulation par D=C3=A9placement d'Amplitude (ASK)</s=
trong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5647" data-end=3D"5702" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5651" data-end=3D"5702">3.1.1 Modulation par D=C3=A9placement de Phase (PSK=
)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5703" data-end=3D"5855" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"5706" data-end=3D"5751">modulation par d=C3=A9placement de phase (PSK)<=
/strong> modifie la phase d'un signal porteur pour repr=C3=A9senter des don=
n=C3=A9es binaires. Les types de PSK incluent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5856" data-end=3D"6061">
<li data-start=3D"5856" data-end=3D"5944" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5858" data-end=3D"5944" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
858" data-end=3D"5894">BPSK (Binary Phase Shift Keying)</strong> : Utilise =
deux phases pour coder un bit (0 ou 1).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5945" data-end=3D"6061" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5947" data-end=3D"6061" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
947" data-end=3D"5987">QPSK (Quadrature Phase Shift Keying)</strong> : Util=
ise quatre phases, permettant de transmettre deux bits par symbole.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6063" data-end=3D"6121" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6067" data-end=3D"6121">3.1.2 Modulation par D=C3=A9placement d'Amplitude (=
ASK)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6122" data-end=3D"6256" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"6125" data-end=3D"6173">modulation par d=C3=A9placement d'amplitude (AS=
K)</strong> consiste =C3=A0 moduler l'amplitude du signal porteur pour code=
r l'information binaire.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6258" data-end=3D"6317" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6262" data-end=3D"6317">3.1.3 Modulation par D=C3=A9placement de Fr=C3=A9qu=
ence (FSK)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6318" data-end=3D"6535" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"6321" data-end=3D"6370">modulation par d=C3=A9placement de fr=C3=A9quen=
ce (FSK)</strong> change la fr=C3=A9quence du signal porteur pour repr=C3=
=A9senter des donn=C3=A9es binaires. FSK est utilis=C3=A9 dans de nombreuse=
s applications, notamment les communications sans fil.</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"6537" data-end=3D"6584" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6540" data-end=3D"6584">3.2 Avantages des Modulations Num=C3=A9riques</stro=
ng></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"6585" data-end=3D"6807">
<li data-start=3D"6585" data-end=3D"6710" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6587" data-end=3D"6710" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
587" data-end=3D"6619">R=C3=A9sistance aux interf=C3=A9rences</strong> : Le=
s syst=C3=A8mes num=C3=A9riques sont g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement moins sensibles=
 aux bruits et aux distorsions.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6711" data-end=3D"6807" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6713" data-end=3D"6807" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
713" data-end=3D"6737">Efficacit=C3=A9 spectrale</strong> : Les techniques =
num=C3=A9riques utilisent efficacement la bande passante.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6809" data-end=3D"6812" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"6814" data-end=3D"6877" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6816" data-end=3D"6877">Chapitre 4 : D=C3=A9modulation (Niveau Interm=C3=A9=
diaire =C3=A0 Expert)</strong></h1>
<h3 data-start=3D"6879" data-end=3D"6916" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6883" data-end=3D"6916">4.1 Processus de D=C3=A9modulation</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6918" data-end=3D"7086" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"6921" data-end=3D"6937">d=C3=A9modulation</strong> consiste =C3=A0 extr=
aire l'information transmise d'un signal modul=C3=A9. Elle peut se faire de=
 plusieurs mani=C3=A8res, selon la technique de modulation utilis=C3=A9e.</=
p>
<h4 data-start=3D"7088" data-end=3D"7118" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7093" data-end=3D"7118">4.1.1 D=C3=A9modulation AM</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"7119" data-end=3D"7294">
<li data-start=3D"7119" data-end=3D"7294" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7121" data-end=3D"7294" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
121" data-end=3D"7140">D=C3=A9modulation AM</strong> : Le processus inverse=
 de la modulation d'amplitude consiste =C3=A0 d=C3=A9tecter les variations =
d'amplitude de la porteuse pour r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9rer le signal d'information=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"7296" data-end=3D"7326" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7301" data-end=3D"7326">4.1.2 D=C3=A9modulation FM</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"7327" data-end=3D"7512">
<li data-start=3D"7327" data-end=3D"7512" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7329" data-end=3D"7512" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
329" data-end=3D"7348">D=C3=A9modulation FM</strong> : Il existe plusieurs =
m=C3=A9thodes pour d=C3=A9mouler un signal FM, notamment la d=C3=A9tection =
de fr=C3=A9quence (en d=C3=A9tectant les variations de fr=C3=A9quence) ou l=
a d=C3=A9tection de phase.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 data-start=3D"7514" data-end=3D"7545" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7519" data-end=3D"7545">4.1.3 D=C3=A9modulation PSK</strong></h4>
<ul data-start=3D"7546" data-end=3D"7744">
<li data-start=3D"7546" data-end=3D"7744" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7548" data-end=3D"7744" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"7=
548" data-end=3D"7568">D=C3=A9modulation PSK</strong> : Pour d=C3=A9mouler =
un signal PSK, on utilise une technique de <strong data-start=3D"7628" data=
-end=3D"7650">coh=C3=A9rence de phase</strong>, o=C3=B9 on d=C3=A9tecte le =
changement de phase du signal porteur pour d=C3=A9terminer les donn=C3=A9es=
 binaires.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7746" data-end=3D"7749" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"7751" data-end=3D"7837" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7753" data-end=3D"7837">Chapitre 5 : Applications de la Modulation et de la=
 D=C3=A9modulation (Niveau Avanc=C3=A9)</strong></h1>
<h2 data-start=3D"7839" data-end=3D"7890" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7842" data-end=3D"7890">5.1 Applications dans les T=C3=A9l=C3=A9communicati=
ons</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"7892" data-end=3D"8089" class=3D"">Les syst=C3=A8mes de co=
mmunication modernes (comme les r=C3=A9seaux mobiles, la radio, la t=C3=A9l=
=C3=A9vision, et Internet) utilisent diverses techniques de modulation pour=
 transmettre de l'information. Par exemple :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8090" data-end=3D"8370">
<li data-start=3D"8090" data-end=3D"8158" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8092" data-end=3D"8158" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
092" data-end=3D"8115">T=C3=A9l=C3=A9vision et Radio</strong> : Les signaux=
 sont modul=C3=A9s en AM ou en FM.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8159" data-end=3D"8370" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8161" data-end=3D"8370" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
161" data-end=3D"8197">Transmission de donn=C3=A9es sans fil</strong> : Les=
 r=C3=A9seaux Wi-Fi et les r=C3=A9seaux cellulaires utilisent des technique=
s avanc=C3=A9es de modulation num=C3=A9rique (comme QAM, PSK, et FSK) pour =
transmettre des donn=C3=A9es =C3=A0 haut d=C3=A9bit.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 data-start=3D"8372" data-end=3D"8419" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8375" data-end=3D"8419">5.2 Transmission de Donn=C3=A9es sur Internet</stro=
ng></h2>
<p data-start=3D"8421" data-end=3D"8541" class=3D"">Les modulations num=C3=
=A9riques sont essentielles pour les technologies de transmission de donn=
=C3=A9es haute vitesse, y compris :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8542" data-end=3D"8781">
<li data-start=3D"8542" data-end=3D"8635" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8544" data-end=3D"8635" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
544" data-end=3D"8561">Fibre optique</strong> : La transmission de donn=C3=
=A9es se fait par des signaux modul=C3=A9s optiquement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8636" data-end=3D"8781" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8638" data-end=3D"8781" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
638" data-end=3D"8656">Wi-Fi et 4G/5G</strong> : La modulation QAM (Quadrat=
ure Amplitude Modulation) est largement utilis=C3=A9e pour les communicatio=
ns sans fil haute vitesse.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"8783" data-end=3D"8786" class=3D"">
<h1 data-start=3D"8788" data-end=3D"8804" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8790" data-end=3D"8804">Conclusion</strong></h1>
<p data-start=3D"8806" data-end=3D"9433" class=3D"">La modulation et la d=
=C3=A9modulation sont des techniques fondamentales dans le domaine des t=C3=
=A9l=C3=A9communications, utilis=C3=A9es pour permettre la transmission eff=
icace et fiable de donn=C3=A9es sur de longues distances. Bien que la modul=
ation analogique reste utilis=C3=A9e dans certaines applications, la modula=
