</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4389" data-end=3D"5072">
<li data-start=3D"4389" data-end=3D"4731" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4391" data-end=3D"4406" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
391" data-end=3D"4404">Avantages</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4409" data-end=3D"4731">
<li data-start=3D"4409" data-end=3D"4494" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4411" data-end=3D"4494" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
411" data-end=3D"4426">Plus rapide</strong> que TCP car il n'y a pas de m=
=C3=A9canismes de contr=C3=B4le suppl=C3=A9mentaires.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4497" data-end=3D"4595" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4499" data-end=3D"4595" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
499" data-end=3D"4521">Moins de surcharge</strong> : Pas de connexion ni de=
 gestion des paquets, ce qui rend UDP plus l=C3=A9ger.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4598" data-end=3D"4731" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4600" data-end=3D"4731" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
600" data-end=3D"4645">Id=C3=A9al pour des applications en temps r=C3=A9el<=
/strong> : Comme la voix sur IP (VoIP) ou les jeux en ligne o=C3=B9 la late=
nce doit =C3=AAtre minimis=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4732" data-end=3D"5072" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4734" data-end=3D"4753" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
