<ul data-start=3D"4756" data-end=3D"5072">
<li data-start=3D"4756" data-end=3D"4861" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4758" data-end=3D"4861" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
758" data-end=3D"4790">Pas de garantie de livraison</strong> : Les paquets =
peuvent se perdre sans que le r=C3=A9cepteur en soit inform=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4864" data-end=3D"4958" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4866" data-end=3D"4958" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
