<h3 data-start=3D"2284" data-end=3D"2317" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2288" data-end=3D"2317">2.2 Qu'est-ce que HTTPS ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2318" data-end=3D"2579" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"2321" data-end=3D"2367">Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure (HTTPS)</str=
ong> est la version s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e de HTTP. Il utilise une couche de s=
=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement <strong data-start=3D"2450" data-=
end=3D"2461">SSL/TLS</strong> (Secure Sockets Layer / Transport Layer Secur=
ity), pour chiffrer les donn=C3=A9es =C3=A9chang=C3=A9es entre le client et=
 le serveur.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"2581" data-end=3D"2615" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2586" data-end=3D"2615">Pourquoi utiliser HTTPS ?</strong></h4>
<p data-start=3D"2616" data-end=3D"2887" class=3D"">HTTPS est utilis=C3=A9 =
pour prot=C3=A9ger la confidentialit=C3=A9 des donn=C3=A9es =C3=A9chang=C3=
=A9es, particuli=C3=A8rement sur les sites n=C3=A9cessitant des information=
s sensibles, comme les sites de commerce =C3=A9lectronique, les services ba=
ncaires en ligne, ou les sites n=C3=A9cessitant un login. HTTPS garantit :<=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"2888" data-end=3D"3126">
<li data-start=3D"2888" data-end=3D"2939" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2890" data-end=3D"2939" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"2893" data-end=3D"2912">confidentialit=C3=A9</strong> des donn=C3=A9es =
(chiffrement).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2940" data-end=3D"3025" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2942" data-end=3D"3025" class=3D"">L'<strong data-start=3D=
"2944" data-end=3D"2957">int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9</strong> des donn=C3=A9es (v=
=C3=A9rification que les donn=C3=A9es n'ont pas =C3=A9t=C3=A9 modifi=C3=A9e=
s).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3026" data-end=3D"3126" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3028" data-end=3D"3126" class=3D"">L'<strong data-start=3D=
"3030" data-end=3D"3046">authenticit=C3=A9</strong> du serveur (v=C3=A9rifi=
cation de l'identit=C3=A9 du serveur via des certificats SSL/TLS).</p>
</li>
</ul>
