=3D"3736" data-end=3D"3739">
D=C3=A9couper <code data-start=3D"3748" data-end=3D"3764">192.168.1.0/24</c=
ode> en 4 sous-r=C3=A9seaux (<code data-start=3D"3784" data-end=3D"3789">/2=
