<p data-start=3D"2256" data-end=3D"2332" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
256" data-end=3D"2276">La partie r=C3=A9seau</strong> : identifie le r=C3=
=A9seau auquel appartient l'adresse IP.</p>
