/h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3477">
<li data-start=3D"3184" data-end=3D"3246" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3187" data-end=3D"3246" class=3D"">Connectez-vous au route=
ur via un c=C3=A2ble Ethernet ou Wi-Fi.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3247" data-end=3D"3327" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3250" data-end=3D"3327" class=3D"">Ouvrez un navigateur et=
