<h2 data-start=3D"2459" data-end=3D"2509" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2462" data-end=3D"2509">1. Introduction aux Points d'Acc=C3=A8s Sans Fil</s=
trong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2511" data-end=3D"2560" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2515" data-end=3D"2560">1.1 D=C3=A9finition et R=C3=B4le des Points d'Acc=
=C3=A8s</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2561" data-end=3D"2905" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"2564" data-end=3D"2590">point d'acc=C3=A8s sans fil</strong> est un dis=
positif qui permet =C3=A0 des appareils sans fil (comme des ordinateurs, de=
s smartphones, etc.) de se connecter =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9seau local en utilisa=
nt des ondes radio. Il se connecte g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement =C3=A0 un r=C3=A9=
seau c=C3=A2bl=C3=A9 (LAN) et =C3=A9met un signal sans fil que les appareil=
s peuvent d=C3=A9tecter et utiliser pour acc=C3=A9der au r=C3=A9seau.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2907" data-end=3D"2967" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2911" data-end=3D"2967">1.2 Diff=C3=A9rences entre un Point d'Acc=C3=A8s et=
 un Routeur</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2968" data-end=3D"3266">
<li data-start=3D"2968" data-end=3D"3065" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2970" data-end=3D"3065" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
970" data-end=3D"2981">Routeur</strong> : Permet de connecter un r=C3=A9sea=
u local =C3=A0 Internet et g=C3=A8re l'adressage IP (via DHCP).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3066" data-end=3D"3266" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3068" data-end=3D"3266" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
068" data-end=3D"3085">Point d'acc=C3=A8s</strong> : =C3=89tend la couvertu=
re sans fil du r=C3=A9seau local. Il ne g=C3=A8re pas directement l'attribu=
tion des adresses IP, mais agit comme un "pont" entre les appareils sans fi=
l et le r=C3=A9seau c=C3=A2bl=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3268" data-end=3D"3303" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3272" data-end=3D"3303">1.3 Types de Points d'Acc=C3=A8s</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3764">
<li data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3420" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
306" data-end=3D"3333">Point d'acc=C3=A8s int=C3=A9rieur</strong> : Id=C3=
=A9al pour les environnements domestiques et de bureau, avec une couverture=
 limit=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3421" data-end=3D"3531" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3423" data-end=3D"3531" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
423" data-end=3D"3450">Point d'acc=C3=A8s ext=C3=A9rieur</strong> : Utilis=
=C3=A9 dans des espaces ouverts, comme des zones industrielles ou des campu=
s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3532" data-end=3D"3644" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3534" data-end=3D"3644" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
534" data-end=3D"3556">Point d'acc=C3=A8s g=C3=A9r=C3=A9</strong> : Contr=
=C3=B4l=C3=A9 par un contr=C3=B4leur centralis=C3=A9 (souvent utilis=C3=A9 =
dans les grandes entreprises).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3645" data-end=3D"3764" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3647" data-end=3D"3764" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
647" data-end=3D"3673">Point d'acc=C3=A8s non g=C3=A9r=C3=A9</strong> : Con=
figuration autonome, g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement utilis=C3=A9 dans les petites e=
ntreprises ou =C3=A0 domicile.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3766" data-end=3D"3769" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"3771" data-end=3D"3818" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3774" data-end=3D"3818">2. Acc=C3=A8s et Connexion =C3=A0 un Point d'Acc=C3=
=A8s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3820" data-end=3D"3863" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3824" data-end=3D"3863">2.1 Connexion via une Interface Web</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3864" data-end=3D"3986" class=3D"">La majorit=C3=A9 des po=
ints d'acc=C3=A8s modernes peuvent =C3=AAtre configur=C3=A9s via une interf=
ace Web accessible =C3=A0 partir d'un navigateur.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"3988" data-end=3D"4369">
<li data-start=3D"3988" data-end=3D"4069" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3991" data-end=3D"4069" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
991" data-end=3D"4013">Connectez votre PC</strong> au point d'acc=C3=A8s vi=
a c=C3=A2ble Ethernet ou connexion Wi-Fi.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4070" data-end=3D"4187" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4073" data-end=3D"4187" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
073" data-end=3D"4097">Ouvrez un navigateur</strong> et entrez l'adresse IP=
 du point d'acc=C3=A8s (g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ralement quelque chose comme <code da=
ta-start=3D"4172" data-end=3D"4185">192.168.1.1</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4188" data-end=3D"4306" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4191" data-end=3D"4306" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
191" data-end=3D"4209">Connectez-vous</strong> en utilisant le nom d'utilis=
ateur et le mot de passe par d=C3=A9faut (souvent "admin" pour les deux).</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4307" data-end=3D"4369" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4310" data-end=3D"4369" class=3D"">Vous acc=C3=A9dez alors=
 =C3=A0 l'interface Web pour la configuration.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4371" data-end=3D"4430" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4375" data-end=3D"4430">2.2 Connexion via Interface CLI (Ligne de Commande)=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4431" data-end=3D"4565" class=3D"">Certains points d'acc=
=C3=A8s (souvent des mod=C3=A8les professionnels) permettent la configurati=
on via une interface en ligne de commande (CLI).</p>
<ol data-start=3D"4567" data-end=3D"4812">
<li data-start=3D"4567" data-end=3D"4650" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4570" data-end=3D"4650" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
570" data-end=3D"4588">Connectez-vous</strong> au point d'acc=C3=A8s via un=
 c=C3=A2ble console (si n=C3=A9cessaire) ou SSH.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4651" data-end=3D"4812" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4654" data-end=3D"4684" class=3D"">Utilisez des commandes =
comme :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4688" data-end=3D"4812">
<li data-start=3D"4688" data-end=3D"4748" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4690" data-end=3D"4748" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"469=
0" data-end=3D"4711">show running-config</code> pour voir la configuration =
actuelle.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4752" data-end=3D"4812" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4754" data-end=3D"4812" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"475=
4" data-end=3D"4774">configure terminal</code> pour entrer en mode de confi=
guration.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"4814" data-end=3D"4862" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4818" data-end=3D"4862">2.3 Configuration via Application Mobile</strong></=
h3>
<p data-start=3D"4863" data-end=3D"5031" class=3D"">Certains points d'acc=
=C3=A8s modernes, comme ceux des syst=C3=A8mes Wi-Fi Mesh, offrent des appl=
ications mobiles qui permettent une gestion simplifi=C3=A9e via smartphone =
ou tablette.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5033" data-end=3D"5036" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5038" data-end=3D"5088" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5041" data-end=3D"5088">3. Configuration de Base d'un Point d'Acc=C3=A8s</s=
trong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5090" data-end=3D"5130" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5094" data-end=3D"5130">3.1 Acc=C3=A8s aux Param=C3=A8tres de Base</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5131" data-end=3D"5253" class=3D"">Apr=C3=A8s vous =C3=AAt=
re connect=C3=A9 =C3=A0 l'interface Web du point d'acc=C3=A8s, vous pouvez =
commencer =C3=A0 personnaliser les param=C3=A8tres de base.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5255" data-end=3D"5313" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5259" data-end=3D"5313">3.2 Configuration du SSID (Service Set Identifier)<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5314" data-end=3D"5445" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"5317" data-end=3D"5325">SSID</strong> est le nom du r=C3=A9seau sans fi=
l. C'est ce que les utilisateurs voient lorsqu'ils cherchent des r=C3=A9sea=
ux Wi-Fi =C3=A0 proximit=C3=A9.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"5447" data-end=3D"5601">
<li data-start=3D"5447" data-end=3D"5525" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5450" data-end=3D"5525" class=3D"">Allez dans la section <=
strong data-start=3D"5472" data-end=3D"5495">"Wireless Settings"</strong> o=
u <strong data-start=3D"5499" data-end=3D"5524">"Wi-Fi Configuration"</stro=
ng>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5526" data-end=3D"5601" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5529" data-end=3D"5601" class=3D"">D=C3=A9finissez un nom =
unique pour votre SSID (par exemple, "MonR=C3=A9seauWiFi").</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"5603" data-end=3D"5651" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5607" data-end=3D"5651">3.3 Choix des Canaux Wi-Fi et Fr=C3=A9quences</stro=
ng></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5652" data-end=3D"5995">
<li data-start=3D"5652" data-end=3D"5830" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5654" data-end=3D"5830" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
654" data-end=3D"5674">2.4 GHz vs 5 GHz</strong> : Le 2.4 GHz offre une por=
t=C3=A9e plus longue mais est plus sujet =C3=A0 la congestion. Le 5 GHz off=
re de meilleures performances, mais avec une port=C3=A9e plus courte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5831" data-end=3D"5995" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5833" data-end=3D"5995" class=3D"">Choisissez un <strong d=
ata-start=3D"5847" data-end=3D"5862">canal Wi-Fi</strong> optimal pour =C3=
=A9viter l'interf=C3=A9rence avec d'autres r=C3=A9seaux voisins. Les canaux=
 recommand=C3=A9s pour le 2.4 GHz sont les canaux 1, 6 et 11.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5997" data-end=3D"6041" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6001" data-end=3D"6041">3.4 S=C3=A9curisation de l'Acc=C3=A8s Sans Fil</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6042" data-end=3D"6129" class=3D"">Il est crucial de s=C3=
=A9curiser l'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 votre r=C3=A9seau sans fil pour =C3=A9viter =
les intrusions.</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6131" data-end=3D"6284">
<li data-start=3D"6131" data-end=3D"6207" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6134" data-end=3D"6207" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
134" data-end=3D"6175">S=C3=A9lectionnez un protocole de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9=
</strong> : WPA2 ou WPA3 (si disponible).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6208" data-end=3D"6284" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6211" data-end=3D"6284" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
211" data-end=3D"6246">D=C3=A9finissez un mot de passe fort</strong> pour l=
'acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 votre r=C3=A9seau sans fil.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"6286" data-end=3D"6289" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6291" data-end=3D"6322" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6294" data-end=3D"6322">4. Configuration Avanc=C3=A9e</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6324" data-end=3D"6365" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
