<p data-start=3D"1802" data-end=3D"1847" class=3D"">S=C3=A9curisation des A=
PI et des services en ligne</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1851" data-end=3D"1893" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1853" data-end=3D"1893" class=3D"">Gestion des vuln=C3=A9r=
abilit=C3=A9s des logiciels</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1895" data-end=3D"2069" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1898" data-end=3D"1922" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
898" data-end=3D"1922">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des Donn=C3=A9es</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1926" data-end=3D"2069">
<li data-start=3D"1926" data-end=3D"1974" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1928" data-end=3D"1974" class=3D"">Chiffrement des donn=C3=
=A9es au repos et en transit</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1978" data-end=3D"2024" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1980" data-end=3D"2024" class=3D"">Sauvegardes et gestion =
des donn=C3=A9es sensibles</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2028" data-end=3D"2069" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2030" data-end=3D"2069" class=3D"">Contr=C3=B4les d'acc=C3=
=A8s et audits de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2071" data-end=3D"2281" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2074" data-end=3D"2120" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
074" data-end=3D"2120">S=C3=A9curisation des Syst=C3=A8mes de Communication=
</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2124" data-end=3D"2281">
<li data-start=3D"2124" data-end=3D"2166" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2126" data-end=3D"2166" class=3D"">Protocoles s=C3=A9curis=
=C3=A9s : HTTPS, SFTP, etc.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2170" data-end=3D"2215" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2172" data-end=3D"2215" class=3D"">S=C3=A9curisation des e=
-mails : SPF, DKIM, DMARC</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2219" data-end=3D"2281" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2221" data-end=3D"2281" class=3D"">S=C3=A9curisation de la=
 messagerie instantan=C3=A9e et des appels VoIP</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2283" data-end=3D"2474" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2286" data-end=3D"2334" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
286" data-end=3D"2334">R=C3=A9ponse aux Incidents et Gestion des Risques</s=
trong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2338" data-end=3D"2474">
<li data-start=3D"2338" data-end=3D"2373" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2340" data-end=3D"2373" class=3D"">D=C3=A9tection d'incide=
nts de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2377" data-end=3D"2420" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2379" data-end=3D"2420" class=3D"">Planification de la r=
=C3=A9ponse aux incidents</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2424" data-end=3D"2474" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2426" data-end=3D"2474" class=3D"">Gestion des risques et =
analyses de vuln=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2476" data-end=3D"2694" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2479" data-end=3D"2512" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
479" data-end=3D"2512">Outils et Techniques Avanc=C3=A9es</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2516" data-end=3D"2694">
<li data-start=3D"2516" data-end=3D"2579" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2518" data-end=3D"2579" class=3D"">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des =
applications avec WAF (Web Application Firewall)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2583" data-end=3D"2643" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2585" data-end=3D"2643" class=3D"">Syst=C3=A8mes de gestio=
n de la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 de l'information (SIEM)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2647" data-end=3D"2694" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2649" data-end=3D"2694" class=3D"">Utilisation de la block=
chain pour la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2696" data-end=3D"2926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2700" data-end=3D"2746" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"2=
700" data-end=3D"2746">Meilleures Pratiques et Normes de S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9=
</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2751" data-end=3D"2926">
<li data-start=3D"2751" data-end=3D"2808" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2753" data-end=3D"2808" class=3D"">Conformit=C3=A9 aux nor=
mes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 : ISO/IEC 27001, GDPR</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2813" data-end=3D"2855" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2815" data-end=3D"2855" class=3D"">Strat=C3=A9gies de gest=
ion des vuln=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2860" data-end=3D"2926" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"2862" data-end=3D"2926" class=3D"">Formation et sensibilis=
ation =C3=A0 la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 pour les utilisateurs</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start=3D"2928" data-end=3D"2931" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"2933" data-end=3D"2982" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2936" data-end=3D"2982">1. Introduction =C3=A0 la S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 Inform=
atique</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2984" data-end=3D"3036" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2988" data-end=3D"3036">1.1 Qu'est-ce que la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 informatiqu=
e ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3037" data-end=3D"3310" class=3D"">La <strong data-start=
=3D"3040" data-end=3D"3065">s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 informatique</strong> englob=
e l'ensemble des pratiques et des technologies mises en =C5=93uvre pour pro=
t=C3=A9ger les syst=C3=A8mes informatiques, les r=C3=A9seaux, les donn=C3=
=A9es, et les utilisateurs contre les acc=C3=A8s non autoris=C3=A9s, les cy=
berattaques, la corruption ou la perte de donn=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3312" data-end=3D"3392" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3316" data-end=3D"3392">1.2 Objectifs de la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 : Confidenti=
alit=C3=A9, Int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9, Disponibilit=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3393" data-end=3D"3460" class=3D"">Les trois objectifs fon=
damentaux de la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 informatique sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3461" data-end=3D"3818">
<li data-start=3D"3461" data-end=3D"3562" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3463" data-end=3D"3562" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
463" data-end=3D"3482">Confidentialit=C3=A9</strong> : Assurer que les info=
rmations ne sont accessibles qu'aux personnes autoris=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3563" data-end=3D"3681" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3565" data-end=3D"3681" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
565" data-end=3D"3578">Int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9</strong> : Garantir que les donn=
=C3=A9es sont exactes, compl=C3=A8tes et n=E2=80=99ont pas =C3=A9t=C3=A9 al=
t=C3=A9r=C3=A9es de mani=C3=A8re non autoris=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3682" data-end=3D"3818" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3684" data-end=3D"3818" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
684" data-end=3D"3701">Disponibilit=C3=A9</strong> : Assurer que les inform=
ations et services sont disponibles en permanence et accessibles aux utilis=
ateurs autoris=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3820" data-end=3D"3874" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
3824" data-end=3D"3874">1.3 Types de menaces et attaques informatiques</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"3875" data-end=3D"3942" class=3D"">Les menaces qui peuvent=
 affecter un syst=C3=A8me informatique incluent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3943" data-end=3D"4247">
<li data-start=3D"3943" data-end=3D"3989" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3945" data-end=3D"3989" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
945" data-end=3D"3957">Malwares</strong> (virus, vers, chevaux de Troie)</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3990" data-end=3D"4031" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3992" data-end=3D"4031" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
992" data-end=3D"4024">Attaques par d=C3=A9ni de service</strong> (DDoS)</p=
>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4032" data-end=3D"4075" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4034" data-end=3D"4075" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
034" data-end=3D"4046">Phishing</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"4050" dat=
a-end=3D"4075">usurpation d'identit=C3=A9</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4076" data-end=3D"4173" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4078" data-end=3D"4173" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
078" data-end=3D"4120">Exploits de vuln=C3=A9rabilit=C3=A9s logicielles</st=
rong> (par exemple, des failles dans les applications web)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4174" data-end=3D"4247" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4176" data-end=3D"4247" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
176" data-end=3D"4197">Man-in-the-middle</strong> (attakques de type interc=
epteur de communication)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4249" data-end=3D"4252" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"4254" data-end=3D"4300" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4257" data-end=3D"4300">2. Concepts Fondamentaux de la S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</=
strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4302" data-end=3D"4346" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4306" data-end=3D"4346">2.1 Authentification et autorisation</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4347" data-end=3D"4615">
<li data-start=3D"4347" data-end=3D"4488" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4349" data-end=3D"4488" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
349" data-end=3D"4369">Authentification</strong> : Le processus permettant =
de v=C3=A9rifier l=E2=80=99identit=C3=A9 d=E2=80=99un utilisateur (par exem=
ple, via un mot de passe ou un certificat).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4489" data-end=3D"4615" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4491" data-end=3D"4615" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
491" data-end=3D"4507">Autorisation</strong> : Une fois l'utilisateur authe=
ntifi=C3=A9, l=E2=80=99autorisation d=C3=A9termine quels droits et ressourc=
es sont accessibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4617" data-end=3D"4650" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4621" data-end=3D"4650">2.2 Cryptographie de base</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4651" data-end=3D"4826" class=3D"">La cryptographie est un=
 =C3=A9l=C3=A9ment cl=C3=A9 de la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9. Elle est utilis=C3=A9=
e pour garantir la confidentialit=C3=A9 et l=E2=80=99int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 de=
s donn=C3=A9es. Les principaux types de cryptographie sont :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"4827" data-end=3D"5046">
<li data-start=3D"4827" data-end=3D"4930" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4829" data-end=3D"4930" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
829" data-end=3D"4857">Cryptographie sym=C3=A9trique</strong> : Utilisation=
 d=E2=80=99une cl=C3=A9 secr=C3=A8te pour chiffrer et d=C3=A9chiffrer les d=
onn=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4931" data-end=3D"5046" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4933" data-end=3D"5046" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
933" data-end=3D"4962">Cryptographie asym=C3=A9trique</strong> : Utilisatio=
n d'une paire de cl=C3=A9s (publique et priv=C3=A9e) pour s=C3=A9curiser le=
s =C3=A9changes.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5048" data-end=3D"5105" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5052" data-end=3D"5105">2.3 Contr=C3=B4les d'acc=C3=A8s et gestion des util=
isateurs</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5106" data-end=3D"5217" class=3D"">Les contr=C3=B4les d'ac=
c=C3=A8s incluent les strat=C3=A9gies qui dictent qui peut acc=C3=A9der =C3=
=A0 quoi sur un r=C3=A9seau ou un syst=C3=A8me :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"5218" data-end=3D"5414">
<li data-start=3D"5218" data-end=3D"5315" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5220" data-end=3D"5315" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
220" data-end=3D"5262">Contr=C3=B4le d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s discr=C3=A9tionna=
ire (DAC)</strong> : L=E2=80=99utilisateur d=C3=A9cide qui a acc=C3=A8s =C3=
=A0 ses ressources.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5316" data-end=3D"5414" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"5318" data-end=3D"5414" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"5=
318" data-end=3D"5356">Contr=C3=B4le d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s obligatoire (MAC)=
</strong> : Un syst=C3=A8me centralis=C3=A9 d=C3=A9termine l=E2=80=99acc=C3=
=A8s aux ressources.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5416" data-end=3D"5465" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5420" data-end=3D"5465">2.4 Pare-feu et filtrage du trafic r=C3=A9seau</str=
ong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5466" data-end=3D"5683" class=3D"">Le pare-feu est un disp=
ositif de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 permettant de filtrer le trafic r=C3=A9seau en=
trant et sortant. Il peut =C3=AAtre configur=C3=A9 pour bloquer ou autorise=
r certaines connexions en fonction de r=C3=A8gles de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 pr=
=C3=A9d=C3=A9finies.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"5685" data-end=3D"5688" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5690" data-end=3D"5739" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5693" data-end=3D"5739">3. S=C3=A9curisation des Syst=C3=A8mes Informatique=
s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5741" data-end=3D"5799" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5745" data-end=3D"5799">3.1 Mise =C3=A0 jour et gestion des patches de s=C3=
=A9curit=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5800" data-end=3D"6026" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"5804" data-end=3D"5827">patches de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong> sont des=
 mises =C3=A0 jour logicielles fournies par les d=C3=A9veloppeurs pour corr=
iger des failles de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9. Il est crucial de les appliquer r=
=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement pour =C3=A9viter l'exploitation de ces vuln=C3=A9rab=
ilit=C3=A9s.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6028" data-end=3D"6064" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6032" data-end=3D"6064">3.2 Antimalware et antivirus</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6065" data-end=3D"6231" class=3D"">Les logiciels antivirus=
 d=C3=A9tectent, bloquent et =C3=A9liminent les malwares. Il est important =
de maintenir ces outils =C3=A0 jour pour se prot=C3=A9ger contre les menace=
s =C3=A9mergentes.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6233" data-end=3D"6286" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6237" data-end=3D"6286">3.3 S=C3=A9curisation des comptes et mots de passe<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6287" data-end=3D"6520" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"6291" data-end=3D"6308">mots de passe</strong> doivent =C3=AAtre longs,=
 complexes et uniques pour chaque service. L=E2=80=99utilisation de <strong=
 data-start=3D"6388" data-end=3D"6422">gestionnaires de mots de passe</stro=
ng> et l'activation de l=E2=80=99<strong data-start=3D"6444" data-end=3D"64=
87">authentification multifactorielle (MFA)</strong> sont des pratiques rec=
ommand=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6522" data-end=3D"6581" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6526" data-end=3D"6581">3.4 S=C3=A9curisation des appareils mobiles et term=
inaux</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6582" data-end=3D"6827" class=3D"">Les appareils mobiles (=
tels que les smartphones et tablettes) peuvent =C3=AAtre des vecteurs d'att=
aques. Il est important de les prot=C3=A9ger avec un mot de passe fort, de =
crypter les donn=C3=A9es et de mettre en =C5=93uvre une gestion des apparei=
ls mobiles (MDM).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6829" data-end=3D"6832" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"6834" data-end=3D"6868" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6837" data-end=3D"6868">4. S=C3=A9curisation des R=C3=A9seaux</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6870" data-end=3D"6923" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6874" data-end=3D"6923">4.1 S=C3=A9curisation des r=C3=A9seaux sans fil (Wi=
-Fi)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6924" data-end=3D"7162" class=3D"">Les r=C3=A9seaux Wi-Fi =
doivent =C3=AAtre prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9s avec des protocoles de s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9 comme <strong data-start=3D"7002" data-end=3D"7010">WPA3</strong> ou <s=
trong data-start=3D"7014" data-end=3D"7022">WPA2</strong>. De plus, il est =
important de d=C3=A9sactiver le <strong data-start=3D"7067" data-end=3D"707=
4">WPS</strong> (Wi-Fi Protected Setup) et de cacher le SSID pour =C3=A9vit=
er les connexions non autoris=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"7164" data-end=3D"7218" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7168" data-end=3D"7218">4.2 S=C3=A9curisation des r=C3=A9seaux c=C3=A2bl=C3=
=A9s (Ethernet)</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7219" data-end=3D"7520" class=3D"">Les r=C3=A9seaux c=C3=
=A2bl=C3=A9s sont souvent consid=C3=A9r=C3=A9s comme plus s=C3=A9curis=C3=
=A9s que les r=C3=A9seaux sans fil. Toutefois, des pratiques comme le <stro=
ng data-start=3D"7343" data-end=3D"7372">contr=C3=B4le d'acc=C3=A8s physiqu=
e</strong>, le <strong data-start=3D"7377" data-end=3D"7401">cryptage des d=
onn=C3=A9es</strong> et l=E2=80=99utilisation de <strong data-start=3D"7422=
" data-end=3D"7446">switches manageables</strong> avec des VLANs (Virtual L=
ocal Area Networks) doivent =C3=AAtre mises en place.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"7522" data-end=3D"7583" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7526" data-end=3D"7583">4.3 Mise en place de VPN pour une connexion s=C3=A9=
curis=C3=A9e</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7584" data-end=3D"7777" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"7587" data-end=3D"7594">VPN</strong> chiffre la connexion Internet et p=
rot=C3=A8ge la confidentialit=C3=A9 des donn=C3=A9es en transit. Les VPN pe=
uvent =C3=AAtre utilis=C3=A9s pour s=C3=A9curiser les connexions =C3=A0 dis=
tance sur un r=C3=A9seau d'entreprise.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"7779" data-end=3D"7854" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7783" data-end=3D"7854">4.4 Surveillance du r=C3=A9seau avec des outils de =
d=C3=A9tection d'intrusion</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7855" data-end=3D"8012" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"7859" data-end=3D"7870">IDS/IPS</strong> (Intrusion Detection/Preventio=
n Systems) sont utilis=C3=A9s pour surveiller le trafic r=C3=A9seau et d=C3=
=A9tecter les activit=C3=A9s malveillantes ou anormales.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"8014" data-end=3D"8017" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8019" data-end=3D"8071" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8022" data-end=3D"8071">5. Pratiques de S=C3=A9curisation des Applications<=
/strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"8073" data-end=3D"8118" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8077" data-end=3D"8118">5.1 S=C3=A9curisation des applications web</strong>=
</h3>
<p data-start=3D"8119" data-end=3D"8395" class=3D"">Les applications web do=
ivent =C3=AAtre s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9es contre des attaques courantes telles q=
ue les <strong data-start=3D"8209" data-end=3D"8227">injections SQL</strong=
>, le <strong data-start=3D"8232" data-end=3D"8262">cross-site scripting (X=
SS)</strong> et le <strong data-start=3D"8269" data-end=3D"8306">cross-site=
 request forgery (CSRF)</strong>. L'impl=C3=A9mentation de la validation de=
s entr=C3=A9es et des contr=C3=B4les d'acc=C3=A8s est primordiale.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"8397" data-end=3D"8451" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8401" data-end=3D"8451">5.2 Contr=C3=B4les de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des bases =
de donn=C3=A9es</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8452" data-end=3D"8647" class=3D"">Les bases de donn=C3=A9=
es doivent =C3=AAtre prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9es contre les acc=C3=A8s non autoris=
=C3=A9s en appliquant le principe du moindre privil=C3=A8ge et en utilisant=
 des syst=C3=A8mes de gestion des identit=C3=A9s et des acc=C3=A8s (IAM).</=
p>
<hr data-start=3D"8649" data-end=3D"8652" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"8654" data-end=3D"8684" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8657" data-end=3D"8684">6. S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 des Donn=C3=A9es</strong></h2=
>
<h3 data-start=3D"8686" data-end=3D"8744" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8690" data-end=3D"8744">6.1 Chiffrement des donn=C3=A9es au repos et en tra=
nsit</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8745" data-end=3D"8990" class=3D"">Les donn=C3=A9es doiven=
t =C3=AAtre crypt=C3=A9es lorsqu'elles sont stock=C3=A9es sur des disques (=
au repos) ainsi que lorsqu'elles sont transmises sur des r=C3=A9seaux (en t=
ransit). Le chiffrement garantit la confidentialit=C3=A9 des donn=C3=A9es, =
m=C3=AAme si elles sont intercept=C3=A9es.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"8992" data-end=3D"9048" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8996" data-end=3D"9048">6.2 Sauvegardes et gestion des donn=C3=A9es sensibl=
es</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9049" data-end=3D"9231" class=3D"">Il est essentiel de r=
=C3=A9aliser des sauvegardes r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8res des donn=C3=A9es critique=
s et de s=C3=A9curiser leur stockage, y compris en utilisant des techniques=
 de <strong data-start=3D"9199" data-end=3D"9230">chiffrement des sauvegard=
es</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"9233" data-end=3D"9236" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9238" data-end=3D"9290" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9241" data-end=3D"9290">7. S=C3=A9curisation des Syst=C3=A8mes de Communica=
tion</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"9292" data-end=3D"9344" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9296" data-end=3D"9344">7.1 Protocoles s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9s : HTTPS, SFTP, e=
tc.</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9345" data-end=3D"9631" class=3D"">Les protocoles s=C3=A9c=
uris=C3=A9s comme <strong data-start=3D"9376" data-end=3D"9385">HTTPS</stro=
ng> (Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure) pour le web, <strong data-start=3D=
"9436" data-end=3D"9444">SFTP</strong> (Secure File Transfer Protocol) pour=
 le transfert de fichiers et <strong data-start=3D"9510" data-end=3D"9517">=
SSH</strong> (Secure Shell) pour les connexions =C3=A0 distance permettent =
d'assurer la confidentialit=C3=A9 et l'int=C3=A9grit=C3=A9 des donn=C3=A9es=
.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"9633" data-end=3D"9688" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9637" data-end=3D"9688">7.2 S=C3=A9curisation des e-mails : SPF, DKIM, DMAR=
C</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9689" data-end=3D"9829" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"9693" data-end=3D"9711">protocoles SPF</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"=
9713" data-end=3D"9721">DKIM</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"9725" data-e=
nd=3D"9734">DMARC</strong> sont utilis=C3=A9s pour pr=C3=A9venir les attaqu=
es de type phishing et usurpation d=E2=80=99identit=C3=A9 par e-mail.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"9831" data-end=3D"9834" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"9836" data-end=3D"9890" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9839" data-end=3D"9890">8. R=C3=A9ponse aux Incidents et Gestion des Risque=
s</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"9892" data-end=3D"9937" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
9896" data-end=3D"9937">8.1 D=C3=A9tection d'incidents de s=C3=A9curit=C3=
=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9938" data-end=3D"10154" class=3D"">La d=C3=A9tection pr=
=C3=A9coce des incidents peut permettre de minimiser les impacts. Les outil=
s <strong data-start=3D"10025" data-end=3D"10033">SIEM</strong> (Security I=
nformation and Event Management) permettent de collecter, analyser et alert=
er sur les =C3=A9v=C3=A9nements de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"10156" data-end=3D"10209" class=3D""><strong data-start=
=3D"10160" data-end=3D"10209">8.2 Planification de la r=C3=A9ponse aux inci=
dents</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"10210" data-end=3D"10366" class=3D"">La mise en place d=E2=
=80=99un plan de r=C3=A9ponse aux incidents permet de pr=C3=A9parer une org=
anisation =C3=A0 r=C3=A9agir rapidement en cas d'attaque ou de violation de=
 la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9.</p>
