=3D"10811" data-end=3D"10861">10. Meilleures Pratiques et Normes de S=C3=A9=
curit=C3=A9</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"10863" data-end=3D"10909" class=3D""><strong data-start=
=3D"10867" data-end=3D"10909">10.1 Conformit=C3=A9 aux normes de s=C3=A9cur=
it=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"10910" data-end=3D"11077" class=3D"">Les entreprises doive=
nt se conformer aux normes de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 comme <strong data-start=
=3D"10976" data-end=3D"10993">ISO/IEC 27001</strong>, qui sp=C3=A9cifie les=
 exigences relatives =C3=A0 la gestion de la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 de l=E2=80=
=99information.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"11079" data-end=3D"11132" class=3D""><strong data-start=
=3D"11083" data-end=3D"11132">10.2 Strat=C3=A9gies de gestion des vuln=C3=
=A9rabilit=C3=A9s</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"11133" data-end=3D"11266" class=3D"">Les organisations doi=
vent r=C3=A9aliser des analyses r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8res des vuln=C3=A9rabilit=
=C3=A9s pour identifier les failles potentielles et y rem=C3=A9dier.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"11268" data-end=3D"11323" class=3D""><strong data-start=
=3D"11272" data-end=3D"11323">10.3 Formation et sensibilisation =C3=A0 la s=
=C3=A9curit=C3=A9</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"11324" data-end=3D"11550" class=3D"">La s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9=
 de l'information repose =C3=A9galement sur la <strong data-start=3D"11377"=
 data-end=3D"11413">sensibilisation des utilisateurs</strong> =C3=A0 la s=
=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, en leur enseignant des pratiques comme la reconnaissance=
 des e-mails de phishing et l=E2=80=99importance des mots de passe forts.</=
p>
