=C3=A9 des communications (ISO 27001, NIST)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3329" data-end=3D"3380" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3331" data-end=3D"3380" class=3D"">La gestion des vuln=C3=
=A9rabilit=C3=A9s et des mises =C3=A0 jour</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3382" data-end=3D"3619" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3386" data-end=3D"3427" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
386" data-end=3D"3427">Les D=C3=A9fis de la Cryptographie Moderne</strong><=
/p>
<ul data-start=3D"3432" data-end=3D"3619">
<li data-start=3D"3432" data-end=3D"3495" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3434" data-end=3D"3495" class=3D"">Cryptanalyse et attaque=
s sur les algorithmes cryptographiques</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3500" data-end=3D"3556" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3502" data-end=3D"3556" class=3D"">Impact des ordinateurs =
quantiques sur la cryptographie</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3561" data-end=3D"3619" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3563" data-end=3D"3619" class=3D"">Techniques de renforcem=
ent de la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 post-quantique</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
