4>
<ul data-start=3D"4322" data-end=3D"4672">
<li data-start=3D"4322" data-end=3D"4484" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4324" data-end=3D"4484" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
324" data-end=3D"4348">PRTG Network Monitor</strong> : Outil complet pour s=
urveiller les performances r=C3=A9seau en temps r=C3=A9el, y compris la ban=
de passante, le trafic et les erreurs de r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4485" data-end=3D"4669" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4487" data-end=3D"4669" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
487" data-end=3D"4529">SolarWinds Network Performance Monitor</strong> : Ou=
til avanc=C3=A9 permettant de surveiller la disponibilit=C3=A9 des appareil=
s et des connexions r=C3=A9seau, tout en offrant des alertes en temps r=C3=
=A9el.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4673" data-end=3D"4725" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4677" data-end=3D"4725">2.2 Surveillance du Trafic et des Protocoles</stron=
g></h3>
<p data-start=3D"4726" data-end=3D"4884" class=3D"">Ces outils permettent d=
'analyser le flux de donn=C3=A9es =C3=A0 travers le r=C3=A9seau et d'identi=
fier les protocoles dominants, les sources de congestion, et les anomalies.=
</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"4886" data-end=3D"4910" class=3D"">Outils populaires :</h=
4>
<ul data-start=3D"4911" data-end=3D"5258">
<li data-start=3D"4911" data-end=3D"5072" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4913" data-end=3D"5072" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
