ogicielles des =C3=A9quipements r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"5742" data-end=3D"5745" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"5747" data-end=3D"5789" class=3D"">3. Outils de Diagnosti=
c et de D=C3=A9pannage</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5791" data-end=3D"5834" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
5795" data-end=3D"5834">3.1 Outils de Diagnostic des Pannes</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"5835" data-end=3D"5978" class=3D"">Les outils de diagnosti=
c aident =C3=A0 d=C3=A9tecter les probl=C3=A8mes r=C3=A9seau, =C3=A0 locali=
ser les pannes et =C3=A0 d=C3=A9terminer les causes sous-jacentes des probl=
=C3=A8mes.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"5980" data-end=3D"6004" class=3D"">Exemples d'outils :</h=
4>
