<li data-start=3D"6005" data-end=3D"6078" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6007" data-end=3D"6078" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
007" data-end=3D"6015">Ping</strong> : Un outil de base utilis=C3=A9 pour t=
ester la connectivit=C3=A9 r=C3=A9seau.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6079" data-end=3D"6174" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6081" data-end=3D"6174" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
081" data-end=3D"6095">Traceroute</strong> : Permet de localiser l'origine =
d'une latence r=C3=A9seau ou d'une perte de paquet.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"6178" data-end=3D"6227" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
6182" data-end=3D"6227">3.2 Outils de Test de Connectivit=C3=A9 R=C3=A9seau=
</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6228" data-end=3D"6334" class=3D"">Les tests de connectivi=
t=C3=A9 sont essentiels pour diagnostiquer si un r=C3=A9seau ou un =C3=A9qu=
ipement est accessible.</p>
<h4 data-start=3D"6336" data-end=3D"6351" class=3D"">Exemples :</h4>
<ul data-start=3D"6352" data-end=3D"6622">
<li data-start=3D"6352" data-end=3D"6482" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6354" data-end=3D"6482" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
354" data-end=3D"6368">Telnet/SSH</strong> : Outils en ligne de commande po=
ur se connecter =C3=A0 distance =C3=A0 un =C3=A9quipement r=C3=A9seau afin =
de tester la connectivit=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6483" data-end=3D"6622" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6485" data-end=3D"6622" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
