<h3 data-start=3D"8063" data-end=3D"8120" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
8067" data-end=3D"8120">4.3 Outils de Gestion des Adresses IP (DHCP, DNS)</=
strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8121" data-end=3D"8217" class=3D"">Les administrateurs r=
=C3=A9seau doivent g=C3=A9rer les adresses IP attribu=C3=A9es aux p=C3=A9ri=
ph=C3=A9riques du r=C3=A9seau.</p>
