<p data-start=3D"10218" data-end=3D"10444" class=3D"">Les r=C3=A9seaux virt=
uels doivent =C3=AAtre surveill=C3=A9s de pr=C3=A8s pour d=C3=A9tecter les =
anomalies et garantir des performances optimales. Des outils de <strong dat=
a-start=3D"10353" data-end=3D"10380">supervision des r=C3=A9seaux</strong> =
comme <strong data-start=3D"10387" data-end=3D"10397">Nagios</strong> ou <s=
trong data-start=3D"10401" data-end=3D"10411">Zabbix</strong> peuvent =C3=
=AAtre utilis=C3=A9s pour cela.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"10446" data-end=3D"10488" class=3D""><strong data-start=
=3D"10450" data-end=3D"10488">7.2 D=C3=A9pannage des R=C3=A9seaux Virtuels<=
/strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"10489" data-end=3D"10678" class=3D"">Le d=C3=A9pannage des=
