<p data-start=3D"4743" data-end=3D"4834" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
743" data-end=3D"4758">Flexibilit=C3=A9</strong> : rapide et dynamique dans=
 la configuration et la modification des r=C3=A9seaux.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4835" data-end=3D"4910" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"4837" data-end=3D"4910" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"4=
837" data-end=3D"4855">Automatisation</strong> : permet d=E2=80=99automatis=
er de nombreuses t=C3=A2ches manuelles.</p>
