</h3>
<p data-start=3D"9049" data-end=3D"9293" class=3D"">La mise en place d'une =
infrastructure SDN implique la <strong data-start=3D"9103" data-end=3D"9139=
">s=C3=A9lection de mat=C3=A9riel compatible</strong>, l'installation d'un =
